    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Weather sphere; bardic performance or raging song class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you start a bardic performance or raging song, you may use your control weather ability as part of the same action. As long as the song continues, you may maintain the effect as part of the song without concentration or spending spell points. Once your performance ends, you must either begin concentrating on the effect or spend a spell point to allow it to continue without concentration.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/weather#toc108\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
